The cannonball will hit robot 4 (the yellow box on the right side of the structure). Upon impact, robot 4 will be destroyed. The force of the impact will likely cause the structure to collapse. The top block (robot 3) will fall, and the structure below it will likely collapse, destroying robots 1 and 2 as well. Robot 5 is on a separate platform and will not be hit directly, but if the structure collapses, robot 5 might be affected. However, since robot 5 is on a separate platform and the collapse is localized to the structure, robot 5 will survive.

